# STARTUP
# Read 0-AI-MANIFEST.a2ml, .machine_readable/6a2/STATE.a2ml, and
# .machine_readable/6a2/anchor/ANCHOR.a2ml.

# EVIDENCE
# Distinguish Idris2 model checks, Zig tests, ABI conformance, binding links,
# and protocol interoperability. Source-pattern scripts are not proofs.
# Record missing tools and explicit skips; never report an unrun check as passing.

# FAIL-CLOSED
# Do not report authentication, crypto, or backend operations as successful
# without required secrets/material and a verified implementation.
# Do not build, sign, push, or deploy the current container scaffolding.

# LANGUAGES
# Idris2 and Zig are used in selected packages. Existing binding languages are
# permitted as source inventory; their operational support is unverified.
# Do not add a new runtime/language without documenting scope and toolchains.

# LICENSE
# Preserve file-level SPDX and third-party notices. Original project source is
# generally MPL-2.0. Follow docs/AI-CONVENTIONS.adoc for details.
